  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the carrots and zucchini and cook for 5 minutes, or until they begin to soften.",
    "Add the cumin and paprika and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the crushed tomatoes, chickpeas, salt, and pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10-12 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley and serve hot over couscous.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
